      "content": "REST API for Accelo's service operations (ServOps) platform. Provides access to companies, contacts, activities, tasks, jobs (projects), issues, invoices, contracts, quotes, prospects, staff, timers, and webhooks. Uses OAuth 2.0 with bearer access tokens, scoped to a deployment subdomain.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Accelo",
